# Keep the repository LF-only.
#
# The CI runners and the shell test suite execute these files directly.
# A stray CRLF in a shell script breaks it at runtime ("set: pipefail\r:
# invalid option name"), and a CRLF blob in .github/workflows/ is not a
# valid YAML document for some parsers.  Normalising the working tree to
# LF keeps local runs and CI byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads must never be line-ending converted.
*.ko binary
*.img binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.xz binary
*.bz2 binary
